v1.0.52: Convert Booking Manual picker rows to inline collapsible pattern

Previously, Booking Manual's 4 picker rows (Kostum, Tanggal Mulai, Tanggal
Selesai, Keperluan) opened separate bottom sheet popups via showCupertinoModal
Popup. Now they expand inline with AnimatedRotation chevron + AnimatedSize +
CupertinoPicker/CupertinoDatePicker, matching the pattern used by:
- add_costume_sheet.dart size picker (CupertinoPicker)
- installment_list_screen.dart date picker (CupertinoDatePicker)

Changes:
- Replace _pickStartDate, _pickEndDate, _pickCostume, _pickPurpose with
  _togglePicker({start, end, costume, purpose}) - only one picker can be
  open at a time (auto-closes siblings when opening a new one)
- Remove _showDatePickerSheet method (replaced by inline picker)
- Add collapsible picker builder methods: _buildDatePicker, _buildCostumePicker,
  _buildPurposePicker, _pickerContainer
- Each picker row: trailing Chevron wrapped in AnimatedRotation(turns: 0.25 if
  expanded), AnimatedSize(300ms) below row with picker + Selesai button
- Kostum row disabled (onTap: null) when costumes list is empty to prevent
  opening empty picker

Side effect cleanup:
- All 10 hardcoded Color(0xFFF2F2F7) references already migrated to
  AppColors.background in v1.0.51
- Update doc comment to reflect CupertinoListSection.insetGrouped + inline
  picker pattern
